1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,233
[HANNAH] Yes.

2
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:05,300
I am the chairman's daughter.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,133
But I have no interest
in seeing him.

4
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:14,467
Hannah. Don't go, Hannah.

5
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:17,000
Hannah.

6
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:20,133
Chairman Song already
knows about everything.

7
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:22,333
He's going to be here soon.

8
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:24,367
He left my mother and me.

9
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,600
I don't need him!

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,133
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

11
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:32,700
He's a good man,

12
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,667
and he wants to
be part of your life.

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,200
He already missed his chance.
It's far too late now.

14
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,200
It's too late!

15
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,667
I know you're angry.

16
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,733
I get that.

17
00:00:43,733 --> 00:00:51,033
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

18
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:55,133
My mother...

19
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,367
gambled everything away,

20
00:01:02,433 --> 00:01:03,500
including me.

21
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:08,300
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

22
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,733
And she sold me
to my own father.

23
00:01:12,767 --> 00:01:15,233
There's a difference here,
Hannah.

24
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,467
Your father...

25
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:21,367
wants to make things right.

26
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:29,467
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

27
00:01:31,267 --> 00:01:32,733
Tell me.

28
00:01:33,567 --> 00:01:34,633
You tell me.

29
00:01:35,567 --> 00:01:37,467
If your mother came back,

30
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:39,667
would you give her
a second chance?

31
00:01:39,667 --> 00:01:46,567
[MUSIC BECOMES TENSE]

32
00:01:49,467 --> 00:01:50,800
Do you understand me?

33
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:53,700
You get me, right?

34
00:01:56,167 --> 00:01:57,133
[HANNAH BREATHES DEEPLY]

35
00:01:57,133 --> 00:01:58,633
Please don't force me

36
00:01:58,633 --> 00:02:00,800
to meet the person
who hurt me

37
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:04,467
if you can't even face
your own ghost.

38
00:02:05,467 --> 00:02:12,400
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
